service_unavailable.description:
Microsoft 365 rejected the {service} service for account {entity_name}, so it was skipped; the other services work normally.

Microsoft says: {error}

"The mailbox is either inactive, soft-deleted, or is hosted on-premise" means the account has no Exchange Online mailbox (license), which Calendar, Mail, To Do and Contacts need. Assign a license that includes Exchange Online, or disable the service with *Reconfigure*. The service is tried again whenever the integration is reloaded.
